      "content": "i don't even know why i'm typing this. just feels like i'm running on autopilot. another 14 hour day done, another million dollar deal closed, and i feel absolutely nothing. just empty. like i'm a hollow shell of a person just going through the motions of a life i dont even want anymore.",
